  "Starting cards as posted under '- Starting Stuff -': Hoth 5th Marker Ice Plains, Prepared Defenses, Mobilization Points, Imperial Arrest Order and You May Start Your Landing; these count toward the 60. The 'Starting Stuff' header is not a card.",
  "Posted 'Hoth 5th Marker Ice Plains' dested Hoth: Ice Plains (5th Marker) (Dark-only printing); 'Hoth3rd Marker Defensive Perimeter' the Dark Hoth: Defensive Perimeter (3rd Marker) (Dark); 'Hoth' and 'HothDocking Bay' the Dark Hoth pages.",
  "Posted '4lom With Concussion Rifle' dested 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'Dr. Evazan and Ponda Boba' Dr. Evazan & •Ponda Baba; 'Zuckass in Mist Hunter' Zuckuss In Mist Hunter; 'Ghhk' Ghhhk; 'Podrace Collision' Podracer Collision; 'Darth Maul' the Tatooine-set Darth Maul.",
